    "long_instructions": "#### Readable and clear\r\n\r\nYou’ll practice asking for exactly the change you want, so AI can build it the way you imagine.\r\n\r\n1. Move the sliders for text color, background color, and text size. Watch the gauge.\r\n2. Get the card to “Easy to read.”\r\n3. Tap “Make it look better.” Then tap a more specific phrase. Which one changed the card more?\r\n4. Tap “Start over” to try again a different way.\r\n\r\n*Example: Make the text darker and bigger.*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it say what to change (text, background, or size) and which way?",
